WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
They use gas.

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:05.760
They use almost anything, but they don't like wind.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.880
But they sure as hell like selling the windmills.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.960
Europe, on the other hand, is a long way to go,

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.000
with many countries being on the brink of destruction

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
because of the green energy agenda.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.400
And I give a lot of credit to Germany.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.639
Germany was being led down a very sick path.

